editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md:489:- Deployments: public — the band in wing three (two bouts on the page). Private — the read on Jent's weight in his chair (day 25); **three Storm lanes** for Lira on the honest floor (day 27). Shadow never used.
