editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md:926:**Resources.** The grey-card program (one per coach and fighter) with Karis's margin sums. The six likeness sheets (Brom's group sheet in his kit with the Velmere letters; the "wall" broadside in his coat). Karis's notebook page (the trial rule, the clause, *Again.*). The marbled log (*All of them.*). The duelist's filing in Bracken's pouch. Seln's travel file (the road, the flag, the draw lines). Hesk's clock (an hour fast since the crossroads).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md:932:- **Ephram:** "I'd rather be trial caller of a house that walks in with you"; the trade with Karis's reading.
