editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md:1658:- **Ephram:** at the wider table; not told.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md:1661:- **Vastin:** the entry; his own unease at Level 4; summoned; nothing of fragments, Seln or makers.
