editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/manuscript/chapter-14.md-201-Bracken was in the records hall when Cael went to collect the meet records for the travel file. He stood behind the long counter in his black coat with his sleeves held back by bands, sanding a page, and he finished sanding it before he looked up.
